      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Deception rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Deception Check), Insight rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Insight Check), Persuasion rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Persuasion Check)  
      **Gear** breastplate, rapier  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 12  
      **Languages** Common plus two other languages  
      **Challenge** 1/8 (25 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Rapier.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=To Hit [Rapier]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+1,dicelabel=Damage [Rapier]) Piercing damage.

      ## Reactions

      ***Parry.*** *Trigger:* The noble is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. *Response:* The noble adds 2 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss.

